  4. Discrete Ramachandran steric basins (Proline $\phi \approx -63^\circ$ lock, Glycine $\alpha_L$ turn access) + Flory $R_g$ compactness.
- **Optimization:** Hierarchical discrete Ramachandran basin jumps + 4-residue cooperative segment moves + continuous torsion-space coordinate polish.

